  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Recovery Support for PanNature</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PanNature is seeking support for our organization to recover after being severely impacted by the pandemics. This financial support will help us: - Maintain core staff to keep the organization functional - Cover basic general operating costs  - Continue our public information services on the news portal and social media platforms - Maintain our support for local communities protecting forests and wildlife - Implement the new strategic plan to adapt to the new context</narrative>
  </description>
